B.ajk=new A.hS("Do Fathers/Mothers (Admins) and Sons/Daughters (Members) need separate APKs?","No! One single OurNest APK dynamically adapts its interface based on whether you created the family (Admin) or joined the family (Member).")
B.ajl=new A.hS("Why can't I see old messages after joining?","OurNest uses zero-knowledge End-to-End Encryption. Only phones present when a message was sent hold the cryptographic decryption keys. The server only holds ciphertext and cannot read or restore old keys to new devices.")
B.ajm=new A.hS('How does "Selected" audience isolation work?','When you switch from "Everyone" to "Selected" and choose specific members (e.g. Mom & Dad), the message is encrypted solely with their public keys. Family members who were not selected never receive the keys and cannot see the message.')
B.ajn=new A.hS('What if two families in our Family Tree have a fight? Is there a way to hide them without "Blocking"?','Yes! OurNest includes "Silent Curtain (Peace & Hide Mode)" inside the \ud83c\udf33 Family Tree tab. Unlike WhatsApp Block (which alerts the other person and creates more family drama), Curtain Mode completely hides that family from your Family Tree, Chat, and Birthdays\u2014or puts them on a 7/30-day Peace Pause\u2014while sending ZERO notification to the other family. When you reconcile, 1 tap on "Lift Curtain" restores them.')
B.ajo=new A.hS("Where do sponsor ads appear?","OurNest features clean, non-intrusive family sponsor cards located only on the Home screen between Family Chat and Direct Messages. There are zero pop-up ads, zero video interstitials, and zero distractions inside active chat bubbles.")
B.ajp=new A.hS("Can I hide a relative's family only on my phone, or for my whole family?",'Both! Inside the Silent Curtain sheet, a Family Admin (Father/Mother) can hide a relative branch for "\ud83c\udfe0 My Entire Family", or any individual member can select "\ud83d\udc64 Only On My Phone" for personal peace of mind.')
B.ajq=new A.hS("Why didn't my wake-up alarm ring on Android?",'Android 12+ requires exact alarm permission. Go to your phone\'s Settings > Apps > OurNest > Permissions > ensure "Alarms & Reminders" is set to Allowed. Also set Battery to "Unrestricted" so the phone doesn\'t sleep through the alarm.')
B.ajr=new A.hS("What should I do if a family member loses their phone?",'The Family Admin can open the Family Circle screen, tap on the member, and select "Remove Member". This immediately revokes their access to the family circle.')
B.ajs=new A.hS("How do I turn on Large Text Mode for grandparents?",'Tap the Settings (\u2699\ufe0f) icon from the Home screen and switch on "Large Text Mode". This increases font sizes by 20% across all screens while maintaining WCAG AA high-contrast readability.')
B.ajt=new A.hS("Can people outside my family find or message me?","No. OurNest has no public directory, no stranger search, and no unsolicited messages. Only people with your unique 6-character code who are approved by the Family Admin can interact with you.")
B.aju=new A.hS("How do I add my Photo, Date of Birth, Living Place, Education, and Working Place?",'Go to Settings > "Edit Personal Profile" (or tap the badge icon in the top bar of the Family screen). Once you add your Date of Birth, OurNest automatically calculates your age and adds a birthday countdown in the \ud83c\udf82 Birthdays tab for your family.')
B.pC=new A.Nu(0,"none")
